{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Shepherd</b> — The prayer of the prophet while the land is desolate, that He shepherd His people with His staff and cause them to dwell alone, like a forest in the midst of Carmel." "<b>And they shall graze in Bashan</b> — across the Jordan eastward. And the answer, HaShem said to the prophet."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:16.288099878Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}